{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46853","headline":"怀潇湘即事寄友人 · 齐己","name":"怀潇湘即事寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浸野淫空澹荡和，十年邻住听渔歌。\n城临远櫂浮烟泊，寺近闲人泛月过。\n岸引绿芜春雨细，汀连斑竹晚风多。\n可怜千古怀沙处，还有鱼龙弄白波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}